# works in `tree`, another worktree of the same repository; a Codex session
# works in `work` without reporting its writes.
#
# The store records these two as it opens. The other {"event"} lines need
# what only the daemon prepares: the source index's in-flight symbols
# (inflight_delivered) and its definitions (note_anchor_changed).
